            "text_v2chg_head": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.heading",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h2><strong>What We Changed in This Version</strong></h2>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "h4",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "pretty",
                "color": "var(--color-foreground-heading)",
                "background": false,
                "background_color": "#00000026",
                "corner_radius": 0,
                "padding-block-start": 0,
                "padding-block-end": 0,
                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                "padding-inline-end": 0
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "text_v2chg_body": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Most vacuum bags on the market are built to one generic pattern. Three things about that pattern were worth fixing, so this version changes them.</p><p><strong>A D-ring on both sides of the zipper.</strong> A vacuum bag has to zip shut against the air pushing back at it, and on a standard bag you end up wrestling the slider one-handed while the other hand holds the bag still. Two fixed anchor points means you pull straight through and it seals in one pass.</p><p><strong>Sized to the carry-on, not to the shelf.</strong> At 18.5 by 11.8 by 5.9 inches, the bag lies flat in a standard carry-on or a backpack instead of making you fold it around the corners to get the lid shut.</p><p><strong>Heavier, water-resistant material.</strong> A thicker laminate holds the compression for the length of the trip instead of creeping back open overnight, and it keeps a damp towel from reaching everything else you packed.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "",
